{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">金價上升，現貨金價升近4,400美元一盎司，在七周高位徘徊。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">至於紐約期金，收市報4,419.7美元一盎司，升20美元，升幅百分之0.45。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T23:02:00.229337+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":70,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}